{"candidateAnswer":"Sara and Kyle","evidence":"[D8:4 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! They're doing great. Our one-year-old is so cute, his name is Kyle!\n[D22:7 | 6:59 pm on 5 July, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! That picture was from a trip we took last year for my daughter Sara's birthday - so much fun and good memories! My family motivates me to keep striving for change.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3740268c-8188-5507-8bc4-dafeb8340cb0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:524c66bff471c5d6de0c4ad534acc72196b4cc2bda937923f25abf9b793b6bc4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of John's children?","referenceAnswer":"Kyle, Sara","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"524c66bff471c5d6de0c4ad534acc72196b4cc2bda937923f25abf9b793b6bc4"}}]}